[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584260\">1072C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584323\">1092B60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585222\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584193\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584167\">1016C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the connecting rod cap.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020904.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p><a href=\"#/2585282\">1004E20</a></p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Proceed with the removal \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584186\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>Place the car on a ramp.</p><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585221\">7055B54</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584443\">1016A22</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584442\">1092G10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584167\">1016C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584470\">1076B50</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584290\">1084B28</a></p><p>1. Undo the bolts fixing the connecting rod cap.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021365.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>This operation cannot be carried out on\nthe vehicle. It is therefore necessary to work with the engine at\nthe bench following the instructions in \n                                          <a href=\"#/2585291\">1028H14</a>\n                                           .</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Lower the lift.</p><p>Remove the piston complete with connecting\nrod.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Proceed with the refitting \n                                          <a href=\"#/2584186\">1028H10</a>\n                                           , bearing in mind to only\nwork on the cylinder involved.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Lower the lift.</p><p>Remove the piston complete with connecting\nrod.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the tool (1a) and fit the piston (1b) in the cylinder chamber\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.700.000</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Make sure that the arrow, stamped\non the piston crown, is facing the timing side and that the number,\nstamped on the big end, corresponds to the one of the connecting\nrod cap.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2020905.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Use the tool (1a) and fit the piston (1b) in the cylinder chamber\n(1b).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.700.000</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Make sure that the arrow, stamped\non the piston crown, is facing the timing side and that the number,\nstamped on the big end, corresponds to the one of the connecting\nrod cap.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2021366.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Position the connecting rod caps and secure\nthem by tightening the bolts to the recommended torque using the\nangle wrench.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CONNECTING ROD CAP FASTENERS</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2 + 40°</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001268.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Protractor</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.860.942.000</p></td></tr></table></div><p><a href=\"#/2584171\">1020A20</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584172\">1020A30</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584583\">2110A60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584167\">1016C10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584193\">1032B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584320\">1092A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2585222\">7055B64</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584323\">1092B60</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584771\">4450B04</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584206\">1032D12</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584260\">1072C44</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584236\">1048A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584928\">5530B52</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584925\">5530B10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584254\">1068A10</a></p><p><a href=\"#/2584120\">0010T11</a></p><p>Remove the vehicle from the ramp.</p>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Position the connecting rod caps and secure\nthem by tightening the bolts to the recommended torque using the\nangle wrench.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>CONNECTING ROD ASSEMBLY</p></td><td><p>M9</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>2.5 + 60°</p></td></tr></table></div><di